0..69 Comment "//! This source tests recursive calls that remain open at a variable."
70..73 Comment "//!"
74..140 Comment "//! The checker keeps a recursive call in an arm until the checker"
141..164 Comment "//! knows its argument."
165..240 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses an endpoint that gives this call a value."
241..244 Comment "//!"
245..309 Comment "//! The checker retains the open call below the arm constructor."
310..359 Comment "//! The kernel replays that retained computation."
360..363 Comment "//!"
364..420 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
